        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Pink ribbed taffeta ground, showing darker pink bands, brocaded with polychrome floss and frisé silks. Pattern shows broad, vertically undulating lace ribbons bordered with floral branches; larger bouquets fill interspaces. Corded pink selvedge at right side. A few small stains and loose brocading yarns."@en ;
